          %h2#properties  Properties
          %p
            The
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/principle+of+unique+choice"} principle of unique choice
            holds in dependent type theory, which means that given any dependent anafunction
            = succeed "," do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi x
                    %mo :
                    %mi A
                    %mo ,
                    %mi y
                    %mo :
                    %mi B
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                    %mi x
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                    %mo ⊢
                    %mi R
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
